Third-party material

1. Stop words, in lib/reminisce/analyser/default.ex

   The Russian stop words (@ru_stop) are the Snowball project's Russian stop
   word list as the NLTK stopwords corpus distributes it (151 words, in its
   order), with one word added. The English stop words (@en_stop) are 101
   words of the Snowball project's English stop word list, with six added
   ("also", "can", "just", "may", "us", "will"). Of the default analyser's 61
   Russian endings, 55 are among the suffixes of the Snowball Russian
   stemmer; the stemming procedure itself is not Snowball's.

   Source: https://snowballstem.org/ (algorithms/russian/stop.txt,
   algorithms/english/stop.txt, algorithms/russian.sbl). Licence:
